{"ID":"20240206105000-f5x0vgf","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206105000-f5x0vgf","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206105000-f5x0vgf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206105008-j6d8fbk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240221191643-731rncb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1300,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240221115053-i0kck6v\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":" 绞股蓝","type":"doc","updated":"20240830102110"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206105008-j6d8fbk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206105008-j6d8fbk","updated":"20240206105011"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产长江以南各地区。\n【性状】\t皱缩，茎纤细灰棕色或暗棕色，表面具纵沟纹，被稀疏绒毛，复叶，小叶膜质，常57，少数9枚，叶柄长24cm，被糙毛；侧生小叶卵状长圆形或长圆状披针形，中央一枚较大，长412cm，宽11.3cm，先端渐尖，基部楔形，两面被粗毛，叶缘有锯齿，齿尖具芒。果实圆球形，直径约5mm，果梗长3"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5mm。味苦，有草腥气。\n【性味】\t苦、微甘，凉。\n【功效】\t清热，补虚，解毒。能够调节血压，降低血脂，调节血糖，促进尿酸排泄。用于血脂、血压、血糖、血尿酸过高、高或异常者。"}]},{"ID":"20240206105003-6q4xb5e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206105003-6q4xb5e","updated":"20240221192016"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206105003-d7esmau.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240830095952-7sn99mi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830095952-7sn99mi","updated":"20240830095952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 393px;","style":"width: 383px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkTex